# apps/api/.env.test -- test-harness configuration for `pnpm test` / `pnpm test:coverage` / `pnpm test:watch`.
# Tracked in git (see .gitignore) and holds ONLY placeholder, non-production credentials for the
# local docker-compose Postgres instance.
#
# TEST_DATABASE_URL points at `clokr_test` -- a SEPARATE PostgreSQL DATABASE (not a schema; D-01,
# Phase 101) on the same local instance as the dev database `clokr`. `pnpm run test:setup`
# (invoked by pretest / pretest:coverage / pretest:watch) provisions `clokr_test` idempotently via
# apps/api/scripts/ensure-test-database.ts before `prisma db push` runs against it.
#
# ISOLATION_CHECK_DEV_DATABASE_URL is a READ-ONLY reference target consumed ONLY by
# src/__tests__/test-isolation.test.ts (the TI-01 proof). The running application NEVER reads it.

# Test-mode overrides. ALLOW_TEST_BOOTSTRAP=true is REQUIRED for Plan 73-01 endpoints.
# POOL_MAX=50 supports 4 parallel workers × ~12 connections (D-09).
#
# This file is consumed by docker-compose.test.yml via env_file. It must NEVER be used
# against production. The JWT/ENCRYPTION secrets below are placeholder values for
# local dev only — they are clearly not real production secrets but exist because the
# API config Zod schema requires 32+ char strings even in test mode.

NODE_ENV=test
ALLOW_TEST_BOOTSTRAP=true
POOL_MIN=2
POOL_MAX=50
RATE_LIMIT_MAX=10000
LOG_LEVEL=warn
LOG_FORMAT=pretty

# Legacy test envs (kept for Vitest integration tests that read .env.test directly).
TEST_DATABASE_URL="postgresql://clokr:password@localhost:5432/clokr_test"

# READ-ONLY reference target for the TI-01 isolation proof only -- never used by the app itself.
ISOLATION_CHECK_DEV_DATABASE_URL="postgresql://clokr:password@localhost:5432/clokr"
JWT_SECRET="change-me-in-production-min-32-chars"
JWT_REFRESH_SECRET="change-me-refresh-in-production-min-32-chars"
JWT_EXPIRES_IN="15m"
JWT_REFRESH_EXPIRES_IN="7d"
ENCRYPTION_KEY="clokr-dev-encryption-key-min-32-characters-long!!"
# DATABASE_URL is also injected by docker-compose.test.yml (postgres-test:5432).
